       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. EXCEPT01.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT EXCEPT-FILE ASSIGN TO EXCPTKS
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
              ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS ER-ACCOUNT-ID
              FILE STATUS IS WS-FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  EXCEPT-FILE.
       COPY EXCEPTREC.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-FILE-STATUS PIC XX.

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       COPY AUTHREQ.
       COPY LIMITCTX.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING AUTH-REQUEST LIMIT-CONTEXT.

       0000-MAIN.
           PERFORM 1000-INITIALIZE
           PERFORM 2000-LOOKUP-EXCEPTION
           GOBACK.

       1000-INITIALIZE.
           MOVE 'N' TO LC-GRANDFATHERED.

       2000-LOOKUP-EXCEPTION.
           OPEN INPUT EXCEPT-FILE
           MOVE AR-ACCOUNT-ID TO ER-ACCOUNT-ID
           READ EXCEPT-FILE KEY IS ER-ACCOUNT-ID
              INVALID KEY CONTINUE
              NOT INVALID KEY
                 IF ER-ACTIVE = 'Y'
                    MOVE 'Y' TO LC-GRANDFATHERED
                    MOVE ER-EXCEPTION-LIMIT TO LC-EXCEPTION-LIMIT
                 END-IF
           END-READ
           CLOSE EXCEPT-FILE.
